  "note": "Original wind-up, release and initial follow-through; six painted recovery poses return to the exact original idle. One common scale throughout. Feature-only facial overlays preserve reference skin shading and animate with eased transitions. Previous pass is character-consistent-v7.json. Final totals play one complete Bratty Victory celebration. Original throw/recovery/face metadata unchanged. Future variants share the round seed; prize RNG is independent. Previous config is character-recovery-v8.json. V10: local body-contour correction against the original ready sprite, retaining v9 cell/foot registration, timing and gestures. Previous celebration config: character-bratty-v9.json. Uniform rendering scale is unchanged. V11: preserve the matching original painted head and copper hair through the body contour matte pass. Body below the hair extent, timing and registration unchanged. Previous config: character-proportions-v10.json. V12: Goddess Moment is a second complete painted final-total performance, sharing the original scale and planted-boot registration. Bratty Victory, throw, recovery and facial metadata unchanged. Previous config: character-bratty-v11.json. V13: Money Tease joins the two unchanged celebrations at the same drawing scale and planted-boot anchor. Exact original idle endpoints. Previous config: character-goddess-v12.json. V14: painted cash-tuck and empty-hand return bridges; same 2100ms new-round duration. V13 preserved in character-money-v13.json.",
